L2: //! Call other contracts.
L3: //!
L4: //! There are two primary ways to make calls to other contracts via the Stylus SDK.
L5: //! - [`Call`] with [`sol_interface!`][sol_interface] for richly-typed calls.
L6: //! - [`RawCall`] for `unsafe`, bytes-in bytes-out calls.
